  "SubGoals": [],
  "Description": "This Goal, PLang.Modules.FileModule, is designed to handle file operations based on a specified path. It filters instructions to obtain the file path, constructs the absolute file path using the application's path and a relative goal folder path, and then reads the content of the file if the path does not contain a '%' character. If the file is successfully read, it renders a template using the module type derived from the step.",
